# =============================================================================
# /srv/z13 state-root .gitignore  (SOW §B.2)
# Weights and secrets are NEVER committed. Weights live in manifests/models.yaml
# (URL + SHA256); secrets live in .env / age-encrypted form.
# =============================================================================

# --- Model weights (track via manifests/models.yaml instead) ---
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.onnx
mmproj-*
models/

# --- Secrets (hold in .env / age-encrypted; never plaintext in git) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
age/
keys/
.gnupg/
cc-switch*
.claude.json
*credentials*
*token*
secrets/

# --- Build artifacts (tools/llama.cpp is cloned + built, not tracked) ---
tools/llama.cpp/
tools/**/build/
**/build/
*.o
*.so
*.a

# --- Raw run artifacts (soak CSVs, bench dumps); summaries go in runbook/ ---
runs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.part

# --- Live databases (§G.3: never commit an open DB file) ---
store/*.sqlite
store/*.db
store/*.db-wal
store/*.db-shm
!store/.gitkeep

# --- Reproducible runtimes & tool caches (reinstall/regenerate on a new device;
#     hermes state, skills, sessions and conversations STAY tracked) ---
#     Rationale + full fresh-machine rebuild flow: see runbook/rebuild.md.
#     Git carries config + state snapshots; these paths are re-derivable deps
#     (Node runtime, uv tools, caches) and are reproduced on the target host.
hermes/node/
hermes/bin/
hermes/cache/

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
.DS_Store

# --- M3 state-migration staging (quiesced DB snapshots; regenerable) ---
.backup/
